# AutoHotkey v2: AutoHotkey v2 documentation, Concepts and Conventions, Scripting Language; requirements/languages/autohotkey.md
name     autohotkey ahk

keyword  if else loop while for in break continue return global local static class extends try catch
keyword  finally throw goto until switch case default and or not is
builtin  MsgBox Send SendInput Run Sleep WinActivate WinWait WinClose InputBox FileRead FileAppend
builtin  Hotkey SetTimer ExitApp Reload StrLen SubStr InStr RegExMatch Format true false
fold-case

line-comment   ;
block-comment  /* */
string   " "  : escapes
string   ' '  : escapes
escape        : char=`
sigil    #    : meta
sigil    %    : attr
operators  +-*/&|^!<>=:?~.
calls
